    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so pointless though. everything is just a cycle of getting attached to something and then it's just gone. the silence is so loud it makes me feel like i'm just a ghost in my own house. how am i even supposed to keep doing this when the only thing that made it feel worth it is gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
