    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't think small moments are gonna fix it. it just feels like i'm dragging this heavy thing around every single day for no reason. everyone says it gets better but i look around and it just feels like life is more about what you lose than what you have. what's actually the point of staying in a world that only takes things away?",
